&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, or any other status protected by applicable law. We are committed to providing an inclusive and diverse work environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;When you apply, NinjaOne collects and uses your personal information to review your application and manage the hiring process. To learn how we use, store, and protect your data, and what your rights are, please read our Candidate Privacy Policy at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ninjaone.com/candidate-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;cpp&quot;&gt;https://www.ninjaone.com/candidate-privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/ninjaone/enterprise-account-executive-msp-dach-312606","tags":["Enterprise"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1794747318},{"slug":"senior-software-engineer-typescript-go-berlin-berlin-287203","company_name":"Goegmbh","title":"Senior Software Engineer - Typescript & Go (m/f/x)","description":"&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At go-e, we are shaping the future of e-mobility and the global energy transition with passion, speed, and technical excellence. Operating in an environment defined by rapid growth and breakthrough innovation, we combine regional strength with international reach to build intelligent, reliable energy solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our IoT infrastructure operates at massive scale:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;100+ PB&lt;/strong&gt; of raw telemetry data stored across our infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;250k+ requests per second&lt;/strong&gt; flat, not a peak; and growing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;130+ TB&lt;/strong&gt; of network traffic managed monthly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To drive our next phase of platform scale, we are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Backend Engineer (m/f/x)&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;In this role, you will lead high-impact architectural initiatives: modernization of our API ecosystem, architecting privacy-first telemetry solutions for enterprise markets, and establishing a unified, Zero Trust security model across all our backend systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Your area of responsibility&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale the backend and its data:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the scaling strategy for Go and TypeScript services handling 250k+ requests per second, optimize ingestion pipelines into ClickHouse and PostgreSQL, and design partitioning, retention, and hot/cold tiering for the multi-year telemetry dataset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unify the API landscape&lt;/strong&gt;: Lead the evolution of go-e’s APIs into one long-term platform for internal microservices and external B2B/B2C users, with contract-first design (OpenAPI, gRPC, GraphQL), clear governance, and backward-compatible versioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the API gateway&lt;/strong&gt;: Design high-performance routing, rate-limiting, and transformation layers that securely expose core services under strict authorization policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own backend security: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as the architectural owner for identity, authentication, and authorization as a shared foundation across APIs, telemetry, CI/CD, and observability, including RBAC, fine-grained access policies, Zero Trust service-to-service communication, and tenant isolation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a white-label telemetry platform:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect a modular ingestion and processing engine that runs multi-region, single-tenant, or at the edge to meet data residency requirements, and can be rebranded and configured for OEM and partner solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead technically:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive key architectural decisions through RFCs and ADRs, build consensus across backend, mobile, and other teams, and mentor senior engineers through coaching, architectural code reviews, and delegated ownership of core sub-systems.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Senior-Level Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Track record as a Strong Senior Engineer driving cross-cutting architectural vision across multiple teams and complex domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security &amp;amp; Identity Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Extensive experience engineering distributed security models, including OAuth2/OIDC, PKI, JWT, fine-grained authorization, and RBAC within high-scale platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unified API Design Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong experience designing, deploying, and maintaining unified, public-facing and internal API ecosystems with strict backward-compatibility and security requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Tenant &amp;amp; Sovereign System Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience architecting multi-tenant or white-label platforms, with direct knowledge of data sovereignty constraints, localized data storage, and regional data compliance (e.g., GDPR, local residency laws).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-Throughput Backend Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert-level mastery of &lt;strong&gt;Go&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;TypeScript/Node.js&lt;/strong&gt; in high-concurrency, event-driven distributed environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Engineering at Scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep experience with OLAP-optimized databases (e.g. &lt;strong&gt;ClickHouse&lt;/strong&gt;) and high-scale relational datastores (&lt;strong&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;/strong&gt;), emphasizing high-write ingestion, query tuning, and schema migration strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It would be even better if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IoT &amp;amp; Fleet Management Protocols:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct experience with EV/IoT standards such as OCPP, MQTT, or ISO 15118, paired with high-volume device telemetry processing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Edge &amp;amp; Hybrid Deployments:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience designing applications that deploy seamlessly across public cloud infrastructure (AWS/GCP), localized private clouds, and edge computing environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applied Domain-Driven Design (DDD).&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record applying strategic and tactical DDD to untangle complex business and physical domains: establishing bounded contexts, codifying ubiquitous language across product and engineering, and defining clean interfaces that decouple services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems-Level &amp;amp; Low-Latency Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with compiled, non-garbage-collected languages (&lt;strong&gt;Rust&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;C++&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong&gt;Zig&lt;/strong&gt;) for compute-heavy workloads, memory-constrained environments, zero-allocation networking, or performance-critical telemetry processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be one of the key drivers of our core technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence in our fast-growing organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high degree of freedom in the execution of your projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental well-being support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee discounts on our products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Corporate discounts on a variety of brands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free coffee, snacks and fresh fruit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role is based in Graz or Berlin. Preference is given to candidates based within the European Union and available to relocate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;br&gt;About us&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;go-e GmbH is a fast-growing, successful company in the field of e-mobility and is on its way from being a start-up to becoming an internationally recognised player. From our headquarters in Carinthia, we have already expanded into around 20 countries across Europe. With bold ideas driven by our passion for innovative e-mobility solutions, we are already establishing the technologies of the future. As a green-tech company, environmentally conscious processes are particularly important to us, which is why we place them at the heart of everything we do. go-e employees contribute to a positive working atmosphere through their personalities; their individuality forms the foundation of our shared success.&lt;/h5&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/goegmbh/senior-software-engineer-typescript-go-berlin-berlin-287203","tags":["Development"],"job_types":[],"location":"Berlin, Berlin","created_at":1794747317},{"slug":"senior-sales-engineer-dach-105891","company_name":"Recordedfuture","title":"Senior Sales Engineer, DACH","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;With 1,000+ intelligence professionals serving over 1,900 clients worldwide, Recorded Future is the world’s most advanced, and largest, intelligence company!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;You will work closely with our DACH region account teams to support enterprise customers in Germany, Austria, and Switzerland by addressing their most critical cybersecurity challenges. In this role, you will lead complex enterprise pilot projects and help the transition to a successful onboarding of tailored solutions, ensuring optimal outcomes and long-term customer success. This position demands a strong blend of cybersecurity expertise, technical engineering skills, analytical thinking, and strategic business insight.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Engage with prospective and existing customers, understand their requirements, address technical inquiries, and showcase Recorded Future capabilities &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Planning and managing proof of value engagements &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Developing use cases and delivering product demonstrations presentations &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Resolving critical analytical, technical, and operational challenges &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Promoting user adoption across various use cases &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Traveling throughout the region when required, roughly 40% of the time&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Preferred experience in a Pre-Sales Engineering role, or a Consulting position, focused on Cybersecurity solutions or services. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;A Bachelor’s degree (Master’s preferred) or equivalent combination of education and professional experience. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Technical knowledge in one or more of the following areas:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;SIEM &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;DFIR &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Vulnerability Assessments &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Threat Intelligence &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Security Operations &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Threat Hunting &amp;amp; Research &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Professional experience in analytical roles across domains such as intelligence, military, cybersecurity, or business operations. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to engage effectively with both technical and non-technical stakeholders, from engineers to executive leadership. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Working knowledge or familiarity with Threat Intelligence is a plus. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Proven ability to establish trust and rapport with clients, including C-level executives and technical decision-makers. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Experience delivering customised product demonstrations and managing proof-of-concept engagements. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Ability to identify client challenges and craft innovative solutions that align with their strategic objectives. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Adaptability to thrive in fast-paced environments with high expectations. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;business-level English and German &lt;/strong&gt;is required&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why should you join Recorded Future?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Recorded Future employees (or “Futurists”), represent over 40 nationalities and embody our core values of having high standards, practicing inclusion, and acting ethically. Our dedication to empowering clients with intelligence to disrupt adversaries has earned us a 4.6-star user rating on G2 and more than 50% of Fortune 100 companies as customers.&lt;/p&gt;
