</div><br><strong>For the Senior IT Administrator level</strong><br><p data-start="668" data-end="758" dir="auto">Candidates considered for the <strong data-start="698" data-end="725">Senior IT Administrator</strong> level should additionally bring:</p>

<li data-section-id="1rdefwq" data-start="760" data-end="906"><strong data-start="762" data-end="847">5+ years of relevant hands-on IT administration or systems engineering experience</strong>, ideally in a technical or engineering-driven environment.</li>
<li data-section-id="16ai6d7" data-start="907" data-end="1045">Strong hands-on expertise across <strong data-start="942" data-end="961">Linux and macOS</strong>, with the ability to independently troubleshoot complex endpoint and system issues.</li>
<li data-section-id="2lsifg" data-start="1046" data-end="1162">Proven experience taking ownership of <strong data-start="1086" data-end="1161">MDM, IAM, SSO/MFA, endpoint security, networking, and access management</strong>.</li>
<li data-section-id="xpfcjp" data-start="1163" data-end="1309">Strong networking knowledge with practical experience configuring and troubleshooting <strong data-start="1251" data-end="1308">VPNs, VLANs, DNS, DHCP, routing, Wi-Fi, and firewalls</strong>.</li>
<li data-section-id="1rlg0s2" data-start="1310" data-end="1451">Experience independently owning technical projects from <strong data-start="1368" data-end="1450">solution design and implementation through documentation and ongoing operation</strong>.</li>
<li data-section-id="1gsk0r5" data-start="1452" data-end="1649">Strong troubleshooting skills across endpoints, networks, cloud services, identity, and infrastructure, with the ability to resolve complex issues without relying primarily on external providers.</li>
<li data-section-id="1pc3b32" data-start="1650" data-end="1757">Experience using <strong data-start="1669" data-end="1697">scripting and automation</strong> to improve IT operations and reduce repetitive manual work.</li>
<li data-section-id="i4xu52" data-start="1758" data-end="1903">Ability to proactively identify weaknesses in an existing IT environment and independently propose and implement secure, scalable improvements.</li>
<li data-section-id="hx0dzi" data-start="1904" data-end="2016">Experience acting as a <strong data-start="1929" data-end="1959">technical escalation point</strong> and supporting or mentoring less experienced colleagues.</li>
<li data-section-id="r9dzbj" data-start="2017" data-end="2144">Ability to work confidently with Engineering and DevOps teams and communicate effectively with highly technical stakeholders.</li>
<li data-section-id="378q0e" data-start="2145" data-end="2288">A strong security mindset and interest in taking increasing ownership of <strong data-start="2220" data-end="2287">Information Security, ISO 27001, TISAX, and ISMS-related topics</strong>.</li>

