s. Experience with React Native experience is a plus.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Able to work effectively across system boundaries and collaborate with engineers outside your primary specialism.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Use AI-assisted development tools in your daily engineering work to accelerate exploration, implementation, testing, debugging, and documentation while maintaining high engineering standards.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Able to evaluate and troubleshoot AI-generated output, use effective prompting where relevant, and share practical learnings with teammates.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience working with a public cloud environment such as Google Cloud, AWS, or Microsoft Azure.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with DevOps concepts and practices, including CI/CD, observability, and operating software in production.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Understanding of core application and backend concepts such as authentication, databases, distributed systems, cloud infrastructure, and API integrations.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A builder-first, pragmatic approach: You turn customer problems into shipped outcomes. You take initiative, test and learn quickly, and make clear trade-offs between speed, quality, maintainability, and risk.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Passion for writing maintainable, elegant code and continuously improving how software is built.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A collaborative, positive attitude and a willingness to challenge ideas constructively.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have a builder mindset. You thrive in environments where things are still taking shape, take initiative to move ideas forward, and find ways to create impact even when the path isn't fully defined.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You embrace trying things out over waiting for perfect conditions, ship early to learn fast,