ic can do their best work from day one.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What makes you a great fit</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Technical understanding:</strong> You’re comfortable with APIs, webhooks and authentication flows such as OAuth, and you aren’t afraid to dig into the details.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>AI and automation enthusiasm:</strong> You use tools like Claude, ChatGPT, Zapier or n8n every day and enjoy finding new ways to automate work.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Customer orientation:</strong> You’d rather solve a problem together on a call than send another ticket reply, and you can explain technical topics in a way non-technical people understand.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Microsoft 365 expertise:</strong> You have hands-on experience administering Microsoft 365 and Entra ID, and you’re the person others turn to when something in the Microsoft world doesn’t work.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Strong communication:</strong> Fluent German and C2 English proficiency are required.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Nice to have:</strong> TypeScript knowledge, experience with Apple Mobile Device Management, and experience with any of the systems we integrate with, such as HubSpot, Salesforce, Pipedrive, Google Workspace, lexoffice or sevdesk.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You’ll thrive here if you…</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Can’t stand a broken process, and fix it before anyone else notices</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">See a messy setup as a challenge, not a reason to complain</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Automate anything you’ve done twice</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Would rather get sh*t done than talk about getting it done</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Are the one friends and colleagues call when their tech doesn’t work</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you want a quiet IT job with a ticket queue, this isn’t it.<br />If you want to be the reason things run smoothly at a fast-growing company, you’ll love it.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Why join now</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Real impact:</strong> Help build software that enables businesses to accelerate the transition to renewable energy.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A product people use:</strong> Our platform is already used by 3,000+ paying B2B customers, so your work reaches real users with real-world impact.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>High ownership:</strong> We’re a growing company, and nothing is set in stone. You’ll have plenty of room to shape how we work, internally and with our customers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Fast-moving environment:</strong> Work closely with engineering, product and customer teams, make decisions quickly, and see the results of your work right away.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A great international team:</strong> We work hard, learn from each other, and make sure we have fun along the way.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Gym membership or transportation ticket:</strong> Pick between Urban Sports Club or Deutschland ticket.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Late nights covered:</strong> Uber Eats and Uber rides on us when you finish late.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Great setup:</strong> MacBook, regular team events, coffee and other perks.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Competitive compensation:</strong> We offer competitive pay based on your experience and responsibilities.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">Even if you don’t meet every requirement, we encourage you to apply! Imposter syndrome shouldn’t hold you back — we value tal