<div><span style="font-size: 18px;">&nbsp;</span></div>
<div><strong style="font-size: 18px;">Hello there. We’re Zopa.</strong></div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>We started our journey back in 2005, building the first ever peer-to-peer lending company. Fast forward to 2020 and we launched Zopa Bank. A bank that listens to what our customers don’t like about finance and does the opposite. We’re redefining what it feels like to work in finance. Our vision for a new era of banking puts people front and centre — we’ve built a business that empowers everyone to aim high, every day, to move finance forward. Find out more about our fantastic offerings at <a href="http://Zopa.com" class="postings-link">Zopa.com</a>!&nbsp;</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>We’re incredibly proud of our achievements and none of it would be possible without the amazing team here. It’s not just industry awards we’re winning, we’ve also been named in the top three UK’s Most Loved Workplaces.&nbsp;</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>If you embrace unconventional challenges, are unafraid to think differently and are driven to make an outsized impact, you’ll thrive here at Zopa, so join us, and make it count.&nbsp;Want to see us in action? Follow us on Instagram @zopalife</div><div><br></div><div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">We’re looking for a Senior Analyst to join our Fraud &amp; Financial Crime Analytics team at Zopa.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">You’ll use</span> <span data-contrast="auto">your analytical skills and hands-on SQL experienc</span><span data-contrast="auto">e</span> <span data-contrast="auto">to help protect our customers and the bank from fraud and financial crime, while making sure genuine customers experience as little friction as possible. Your initial focus will be on card transactions and related events, including card tokens and account takeover.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">This is a hands-on role where you’ll own the analysis, implementation and ongoing performance of our controls. You’ll work with large datasets, identify emerging risks and use your findings to design and improve the rules and models that help keep our customers safe.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">You don’t need to have worked in fraud or financial crime before. We’re looking for a strong analyst who enjoys solving complex problems, is curious about how things work and wants to build expertise in this area.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<div>
<p><strong><span data-contrast="auto">Why this role matters</span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Fraud and financial crime are constantly evolving, and so are the products and services we offer our customers. To grow safely, we need controls that can identify and prevent harm while allowing genuine customers to use their accounts with confidence.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">We want to build the next generation of fraud and financial crime controls, using modern data, technology and AI to stay ahead of emerging threats and make our detection as effective as it can be.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">You’ll be embedded in one of our product squads as part of the wider Fraud &amp; Financial Crime Analytics team, working alongside Fraud Risk, Operations, Data Science, Engineering and Product. Together, you’ll help shape, build and continuously improve the controls that protect our customers.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">This is one of the most impactful analytics roles in the business. In the same day, you could be triaging a new fraud risk, designing the controls to stop it and protecting our customers from harm.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">This is an opportunity to bring your own ideas, shape how we solve problems and make a visible impact on both our customers and the business.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
</div>
