<h1 style="margin-top: 24pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><strong><span style="font-size: 23pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">About the Role</span></strong></h1>
<p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Finom is building a brand that European entrepreneurs recognise and trust, and right now the visual side of that brand needs an owner.</span></p>
<p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">We are looking for an Art Director to lead our Marketing Design team and take ownership of Finom's visual identity end to end. Not marketing design in isolation: the brand system itself, the guidelines behind it, and how consistently it shows up everywhere Finom appears.</span></p>
<p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">You are joining at a genuine inflection point. Finom is growing fast, helping entrepreneurs around Europe take their businesses to the next level. We have over 200k users with ambition for millions more. Meanwhile, our customers rate us 4.8 on Trustpilot, the only business banking app above 4.7.</span></p>
<p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Our ambition brings with it a unique set of challenges. Your job will be twofold: raise the creative bar, and build the system that lets a team deliver at volume without the quality dropping.</span></p>
<p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Your first months will be as much about diagnosis as creation: auditing the existing identity, understanding where the current team and workflows are working or falling short, and putting the foundations in place for what comes next. From there, you'll help determine and lead the next evolution of Finom's visual identity.</span></p>
