<li>
<p>Design, build and maintain parts of the robotics platform, e.g. APIs, health monitoring and machine configuration management</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Contributing to high quality code, improving robustness and maintainability of existing code</p>
</li>

</div><br><strong>What we're looking for</strong><br><div>

