</li>
<li>
<p>Develop account plans, forecasts, and tailored growth strategies to support retention and expansion across the customer portfolio.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Track and report key performance indicators, including churn, renewal rates, net revenue retention, expansion revenue, and customer satisfaction.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Manage contract renewals, commercial negotiations, and customer escalations.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Maintain accurate and up-to-date CRM records, including account notes, pipeline activity, and revenue forecasts.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Support onboarding activities and customer transitions when required.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Occasionally travel to meet strategic customers or represent the business at relevant industry events.</p>
</li>

