uirements</li></ul><p><strong>Requirements</strong></p><ul><li>Bachelor’s or master’s degree in computer science, software engineering, electrical engineering, information technology, or a comparable qualification </li><li>Experience developing and maintaining automated UI, API, and end-to-end test using frameworks such as Playwright, Selenium, pytest, or equivalent</li><li>Familiarity with AI-assisted development and testing tools (e.g. Playwright MCP, Claude Code, Momentic, or similar) to accelerate test creation, exploratory testing, debugging, and regression analysis</li><li>Fluent in English and German</li></ul><p><strong>Benefits</strong></p><p>Join our mission and become part of an innovative, dynamic team! At Walaris, you’ll play a vital role in saving lives and safeguarding local and national security by harnessing the power of cutting-edge technologies. This is your chance to break new ground and take on meaningful responsibility as you help develop and deploy industry-defining solutions.</p><p>We offer creative freedom, competitive compensation, and a fast-paced, collaborative environment where your ideas and contributions truly matter.</p><p>If you’re ready to make an impact, we invite you to apply by submitting your cover letter, resume, and transcript through our online application form.</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/walaris/ui-test-engineer-nuremberg-129722","tags":["Engineering","Information Technology and Services"],"job_types":["Full time"],"location":"Nuremberg, Germany","created_at":1794615610},{"slug":"kundendienstmitarbeiter-forderungsmanagement-polnisch-eggenfelden-244627","company_name":"UAI SOLUTIONS","title":"Kundendienstmitarbeiter Forderungsmanagement Polnisch (m/w/d)","description":"<p><strong>Gemeinsam halten wir Prozesse in Bewegung.</strong></p><p>Die UAI SOLUTIONS Firmengrup