 consistent through hands-on quality checks.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">- Collaborate with global and local teams across marketing, product, e-commerce, and sales to deliver effective, on-brand communication.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What You'll Bring</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">- 5+ years of copywriting experience with a strong portfolio of high-quality work for digital marketing channels, including paid ads, email, web, and social media.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">- Excellent writing, editing, and proofreading skills in English, with a strong eye for detail, accuracy, and consistency.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">- A solid grasp of brand voice, storytelling, and persuasive messaging, plus copywriting best practices like SEO, readability, and conversion-focused writing.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">- The ability to manage multiple projects and deadlines in a fast-paced environment, staying organised and process-oriented.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">- Nice to have: experience with AI writing tools and localisation workflows, familiarity with Jira, Figma, and Canva, and knowledge of a European language beyond English or German (e.g. Swedish, French, Italian).</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>💼 Compensation</strong> — Competitive salary · Company pension plan · Capped overtime, fully paid, no endless unpaid crunch</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🚀 Growth and Career Development</strong> — You will take real ownership of your work from the start with direct impact on campaign and business outcomes, work alongside an international team across Europe, and follow fast-track opportunities to grow into senior roles as PERGOLUX scales.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>⏰ Time Off and Flexibility</strong> — Up to 30 vacation days, starting at 27 · One week per year remote workation in the EU/UK</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🌟 Benefits and Lifestyle</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">- Team culture with regular team events (summer party, Christmas party, after-work gatherings) and retreats</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">- Modern setup and laptops (Apple or Windows)</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">- Employee discounts on PERGOLUX products</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">- Jobrad / Bike leasing program, promoting sustainable and healthy commuting</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">📍 <strong>Office Location</strong> – Schlesische Str. 27 C, Building C, 6th floor, 10997 Berlin</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>How to Apply</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ready to shape the words behind our campaigns? Apply through our [Career Page](<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://pergolux.careers/">https://pergolux.careers/</a>) or connect with us on [LinkedIn](<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/pergolux/posts/?feedView=all">https://www.linkedin.com/company/pergolux/posts/?feedView=all</a>).</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">PERGOLUX is an equal opportunity employer. We welcome applicants from all backgrounds, we think it's less about ticking every box and more about what you bring to the table!</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/pergolux/copywriter-berlin-54363","tags":["Marketing"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Berlin | Global Team","created_at":1794595227},{"slug":"support-systems-programs-lead-europe-remote-berlin-462388","company_name":"N8N","title":"Support Systems & Programs Lead | Europe Remote","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The AI orchestration of your wildest imagination.</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">n8n is the open workflow orchestration platform built for the new era of AI. We give technical teams the freedom of code with the speed of no-code, so they can automate faster, smarter, and w