nd a $5.2B valuation following strategic investment from SAP.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>📈 Build towards AE.</strong> We want the SDR role to be a platform for your next step. High-performing SDRs can develop through our structured <strong>SDR → AE programme</strong>, with live deal exposure, discovery and MEDDPICC coaching, call reviews, and opportunities to take greater ownership of real opportunities alongside experienced AEs.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>✏️ Learn enterprise selling.</strong> Work alongside Enterprise AEs on account strategy, stakeholder mapping, messaging, discovery and opportunity creation - gaining exposure to how complex enterprise deals are built from the start.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🤖 Sell where the market is going.</strong> You’ll engage technical and executive buyers around AI, automation and some of the most important technology challenges businesses are tackling today.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>⚡Use AI to sell smarter.</strong> Experiment with AI, n8n and modern sales technology to research accounts, understand buyers, personalise outreach and improve how you work. You don’t need to be an engineer - but you should be curious about technology and excited to learn.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>What you’ll do</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Build enterprise pipeline:</strong> Prospect into a focused set of strategic accounts and create qualified opportunities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Develop account strategies:</strong> Partner with Enterprise AEs to identify priority companies, stakeholders, challenges, use cases and engagement strategies.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Research your prospects:</strong> Understand the business and technical priorities of stakeholders across IT, DevOps, SecOps, Engineering and related teams.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Create outreach that gets attention:</strong> Develop thoughtful, personalised messaging tied to real account priorities rather than generic sequences.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Prospect across channels:</strong> Engage prospects through email, phone, LinkedIn and other relevant channels.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Lead early-stage discovery:</strong> Understand business needs, technical environments, priorities, urgency and potential fit with n8n.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Continuously improve:</strong> Use Salesforce, Outreach, Apollo, AI tools, coaching and performance data to sharpen your approach.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>What we’re looking for</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re looking for someone with a strong SDR foundation who wants to develop into an excellent enterprise seller.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll likely be a good fit if you have:</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">SDR or BDR experience in B2B SaaS, software or technology</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience generating pipeline through outbound prospecting within mid- market or enterprise accounts</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A strong sales track record against your targets</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluency in German (C1 level- fluent or bilingual)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Confidence engaging senior business and technical stakeholders</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A thoughtful approach to account research, personalisation and qualification</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Curiosity about technical products, automation and AI</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Resilience, consistency and ownership of your results</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The ability to work from our <strong>Berlin office three days per week</s