s, tech stacks, and levels well enough to hold credible conversations with candidates and hiring managers</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Excellent sourcing ability</strong>, with a track record of building pipelines in competitive European markets</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience <strong>leveraging AI tools</strong> and recruiting technology to improve sourcing, engagement, and efficiency</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Strong stakeholder management skills</strong>, with the confidence to advise, challenge, and influence engineering leaders</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Data-driven approach</strong>, using funnel metrics and market data to improve outcomes</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hands-on experience with <strong>Greenhouse and/or Ashby</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience hiring <strong>internationally, including relocation and visa processes</strong>, is a strong plus</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Fluent English</strong>; German is a plus</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h2><strong>Our recruiting process:</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Talent Acquisition → Hiring Manager → Technical Interview(s) → Bar Raiser</p><h2>Why Parloa?</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're at the beginning of a new era in customer experience, one where AI doesn't just respond, but understands, reasons, and takes action. We're building agentic AI that enterprises trust with their most important customer moments: complex questions, high volumes, real stakes. When millions of people reach out to a brand, those interactions aren't just support tickets; they're defining experiences. We're here to raise the standard: making every conversation seamless, intelligent, and genuinely helpful. If you care about shaping how businesses and customers connect at scale and want your work to matter in real, everyday moments, this is where you do it.</p><p style=