e whether your ideas show up in the numbers, and you’ll learn how content turns into signups and revenue at a fast-growing startup.<br /></p><h2>Tasks</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Currently enrolled at a university in Germany, and able to work around 20 hours per week during the semester</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You spend a lot of time on TikTok and Instagram and know what's going on there: you notice trends early and can tell why one video gets 400 views and another gets 4 million</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You write well in English: short, clear and funny when it fits, and you pick up a brand voice quickly</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You're full of ideas: show you our product and a few user videos, and you'll have ten things we could post</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You've run a social account before, your own or one for a club, band or small brand, and can show it to us</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You can do basic video edits in CapCut or similar. You don't need to be a video editor</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Reliable: your hours are flexible and you plan them around university, but you check in on our channels once a day and keep a steady posting schedule</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You like talking to people online, and you're friendly and patient when someone needs help</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">AI tools are a normal part of how you work</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You're into music, AI and internet culture</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You're based in Berlin and can join us in the office at least one day per week</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>Requirements</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Currently enrolled at a university in Germany, and able to work around 15-20 hours per week during the semester</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You already make content: you've run your own account or one for a club, band or small brand, and can show what you made</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong instincts for short-form content: you can tell why one video gets 400 views and another gets 4 million</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You can make the content yourself: script, edit, caption and post (CapCut, Premiere or similar)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Reliable and organized: you can plan your hours around university and keep a steady posting schedule</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Curious about numbers: you want to know which posts lead to signups, not just likes</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">AI is part of how you work: you use AI tools to ideate, edit and repurpose faster</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Genuinely into music, AI and internet culture</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You're based in Berlin and can join us in the office at least two days per week</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bonus points:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You've grown your own or a club's account to a real audience</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You study marketing, media, communications, film or music</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You make music, or you're close to the music scene</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You're comfortable on camera</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You edit video well, beyond the basics</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>How we measure success</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our channels post on a steady schedule, sound like us, and pick up on what's happening while it still matters. Users who comment or ask for help get a friendly, useful answer within a day.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Over time, we want channels musicians follow, share and talk about, and that make them want to try Neural Frames themselves.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>Benefits</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Flexible hours around your studies, bi-weekly team lunches, regular team events, an annual summer offsite, learning &amp; development support, productivity tools, and a real path into a full-time growth role after graduating.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Neural Frames is dedicated to creating an equitable, inclusive, and supportive work environment that brings people together from diverse backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. Our strength is in our differences. We're proud to be an equal opportunity employer and welcome all applicants as we're committed to promoting a culture of opportunity for all.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/neural-frames-gmbh/social-media-manager-working-student-ai-music-video-platform-berlin-302221","tags":["Marketing"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1794595218},{"slug":"business-development-representative-german-speaking-berlin-61617","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Business Development Representative, German speaking","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><em><strong>Company Description</strong></em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>We’re</em><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="http://checkout.com"><em> </em></a><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://Checkout.com"><em>Checkout.com</em></a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we’re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. </em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br /><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. </em><br /><br /><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there’s a good chance our tech powers the 