.5em"><strong>Building the AI-first frontier enterprise.</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are a global technology consultancy with a trademarked, AI-first approach<strong>—Gen-e2™. </strong>It redefines how enterprises build digital products and transform their organizations with AI. <strong>We do the right thing, and we do it right.</strong> We're proud to be a World Economic Forum New Champion, and a B Corp-certified company.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· We are small enough to care locally, big enough to deliver globally (<strong>10 countries, 450+ experts from 50+ nationalities</strong>)</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· We are becoming an <strong>agentic organization</strong>, adopting the AI-native operating model we bring to our clients.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· We are<strong> robust and resilient </strong>(100% independent, 0 debt, founded 2009)</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· We are <strong>AI-native professionals </strong>who invest in what we believe and work as a collective intelligence</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· We are positive, courageous and deliver at the leading edge</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2><strong>🚀 Your Role</strong></h2><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">For our PALO IT LABS based in Paris, 17e District, and entirely focused on developing our Gen-e2 methodology, you will use advanced AI tools to accelerate development cycles and drive innovation.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">As a key member of our team, driven by Sami Henchiri, you will lead high-impact, AI-driven engineering initiatives and transformation programs from discovery to delivery. You will be responsible for technical excellence, and client success, ensuring each project aligns with the Gen-e2 speed-to-impact model.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">Your soft skills will help you build or be part of a high-performing team that consistently exceeds expectations by effectively blending human expertise and AI capabilities.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2><strong>🎯 Your Mission</strong></h2><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">As a AI Native Coach Transformation, your mission is both internal and external:</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Lead multidisciplinary engineering and product teams</strong>, delivering large-scale, AI-driven, cloud-native solutions integrating DevSecOps</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Define technical strategy</strong>, support clients in transformative adoption of fully AI-driven delivery models</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Conduct technical analyses, define solution architectures, and facilitate client workshops to determine project technical approaches</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Implement Gen-e2 best practices</strong>, from product repository artifacts to AI prompt libraries for coding standards, architecture, and security compliance</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Train and coach client teams on Gen-e</strong>2, enabling them to adopt AI-driven ways of working and anchor them in their culture</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support organizations in scaling Gen-e2, by <strong>creating strategies and frameworks for enterprise-wide adoption</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Boost productivity and quality by leveraging AI to generate the majority of artifacts while applying rigorous review and validation processes</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Foster an AI-First engineering culture</strong>, mentoring