-height:1.5em">You love performance-driven environments</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h2>Why Join lemlist</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Because this is not a "small BDR internship." You'll join:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">a profitable and fast-growing SaaS company</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">an international environment</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">a high-performance sales culture</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">a company building the future of AI outbound</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>And most importantly: there's a clear career path</strong>. <br />We actively promote internally and want people who can grow into top performers. Several of our full-time BDRs started exactly here.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>What You'll Get</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Intense sales training</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Competitive internship compensation</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Daily coaching</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Exposure to top SaaS sales practices</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ownership from day one</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A modern AI sales stack</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A team that genuinely cares about growth and performance</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The chance to accelerate your career much faster than in a traditional company</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h2>Recruitment Process</h2><ol style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Interview with Victoire (TAM)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Discovery call with Conor (Team Lead Europe)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Business Case &amp; debrief with Yann  (VP of Sales)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Interview with Charles (CEO)</p></li></ol><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Join us to kickstart your sales career and help build the future of AI outbound. Let's keep growing together!</strong></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/lemlist/bdr-intern-paris-58298","tags":["Business"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Paris","created_at":1794606017},{"slug":"gtm-experience-manager-field-event-marketing-paris-348843","company_name":"Lemlist","title":"GTM Experience Manager (Field & Event Marketing)","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em">lemlist is the outbound platform for sales teams: find leads, run multichannel campaigns (email, LinkedIn, calls), personalize with AI and book meetings.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're at +$60M ARR, growing ~50% year over year, profitable and 100% bootstrapped, with 180 people.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">lemlist is moving upmarket. We’re hiring a <strong>GTM Experience Manager</strong> to build our field marketing channel from scratch: bring in bigger deals and help our strategic customers stay and grow with us.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll get the right people in the room and make it worth their time, with speakers they want to hear from, topics they care about and experiences they’ll tell others about. We want people talking about lemlist, and Sales walking away with real opportunities.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll decide which conferences are worth investing in, what to build with partners and which events we should run ourselves. You’ll own the budget and make it happen, working closely with Marketing, Partnerships and Sales.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">The scope is worldwide, with a focus on Europe and our Paris HQ as the home base for our own events. <br />It includes events for lemlist but also for claap, <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.lemlist.com/blog/lemlist-just-spent-over-15m-to-buy-ai-sales-intelligence-platform-claap">the sales intelligence platform we bought one year ago</a> (same target audience).</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1>What your impact will look like</h1><h3>Within 3 months, you’ll have:</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drafted our field strategy for lemlist: audience, objectives &amp; how to reach them through events &amp; strong sales/partners collaboration</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Identify, negotiate &amp; start action plan for 2 must-attend paid Events for lemlist</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Design &amp; organise 2 events with our most strategic partners and generate good pipeline out of it (that would make us breakeven if we have the usual ASP &amp; CVR)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Built a clear operating model with Sales for pre-event outreach, rep selection, on-site activation and follow-up</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Started creating one owned event format that can become recognizable lemlist franchise (eg. GTM monthly breakfasts…)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Organise at least one workshop for one of our strategic account/customer (at our or their HQ)</p></li></ul><h3>Within 12 months, you’ll have:</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Generated 2M$ pipeline out of events, paid or owned - and are breakeven overall (total events OPEX spending &lt; ARR signed and influenced)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Made lemlist events a must-be place for our ecosystem and audience</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run regular workshops for our top customers with CSMs, our Product leaders and/or our CEO, driving measurable adoption and upsell, and producing a steady flow of customer storiesz</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Become the internal expert on the GTM event ecosystem (paid &amp; partners): you know all the relevant events globally, who attends them, which ones are emerging and which ones are declining</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Built a clear investment strategy across sponsored events &amp; owned events with a strong point of view on where we spend and why</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build strong relationships with our key partners &amp; some GTM communities, thanks to successful events</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Built a measurement framework that lets us understand ROI: meetings, pipeline, revenue, brand impact, etc.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Built a repeatable playbook for selecting and activating the right Sales reps at each event so we maximise impact before, during and after</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bonus project: launch the lemlist swag store and build a rewards program to engage prospects, celebrate users and strengthen partner relationships.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h1>What you’ll do concretely</h1><h3>You’ll manage two main types of events:</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Sponsored events:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">third-party conferences and trade shows.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll build lemlist’s presence through booths, speaking opportunities and creative activations (eg. lemlist @ <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.linkedin.com/posts/domitilledesaintexupery_events-can-be-your-best-investment-of-the-activity-7473313038645932032-3egl">VivaTech</a>)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">…sometimes by creating our own event around a major industry moment.</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>lemlist events:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">experiences organised by lemlist for prospects, customers or both.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Meetups at our HQ, the lemhouse in Avignon, executive dinners, IRL workshops in coffees or any venue of your choice.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Webinars with our team, partners a/o users, for our prospects &amp; clients</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You may run them independently or with some of our partners.<br />→ Recent examples: <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.linkedin.com/posts/charlestenot_elevenlabs-just-crossed-600m-in-arr-activity-7486012145122484225-_q-5/">Event for a client at our HQ</a> ; H<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.linkedin.com/posts/julia-guenier-8468ab119_some-events-you-attend-this-one-you-build-activity-7476169392569921536-O8P7">ackathon with Clay and HubSpot</a>.</p></li></ul></li></ul><h3>Curate the right events and partners</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Spot the difference between an outdated tradeshow that won’t attract our buyers anymore and the next place our audience will actually want to be (eg. recent AI / GTM trendy events)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">For sponsored events, evaluate sponsorship opportunities based on audience quality, pipeline potential and brand impact. Assess audience &amp; sponsor list (competition can be a good sign), ask feedback to operators that have been there.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Negotiate sponsorship packages to secure the best value, visibility and booth location. There is ALWAYS room to negotiate.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proactively identify the right partners to build events with, and know when to push back on opportunities that are not worth our time.</p></li></ul><h3>Create content people want to show up for</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Find and convince great speakers to join us for our events. Including customers, sales leaders, operators and partners.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Define sharp themes and angles that reflect what our audience genuinely cares about.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Oversee the creation of agendas, talks, workshop programs and speaker materials, with support from the wider Marketing team.</p></li></ul><h3>Deliver memorable experiences</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own every event from idea to execution, ensuring a smooth experience for attendees, speakers, partners and the lemlist team.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manage vendors and logistics, including venues, catering, booth production, room setup, equipment and travel, with support from our Office Manager for in-house events.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Design experiences people remember, whether through a creative booth activation, an unexpected format or standout branding.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Stay calm when plans change at the last minute. Because they will.</p></li></ul><h3>Turn events &amp; content into pipeline</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work closely with our French and EMEA Sales teams to define the audience, targets and pipeline objectives for our events.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">With our sales leads, select and organise (in advance!) the right lemlist reps for each event.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Get Sales moving before the event: activating their networks, booking meetings and running targeted outreach.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the follow-up plan after the event so conversations turn into real opportunities</p></li></ul><h3>Own the budget and performance</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own a €300K annual budget covering field marketing activities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Track sourced and influenced pipeline, meetings, opportunities and conversion rates, then share clear post-event learnings.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h1>About you</h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>B2B SaaS native:</strong> you know the European Sales and GTM ecosystem, its key players, communities and events.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Passionate about Sales:</strong> ideally, you’ve worked in Sales yourself and instinctively know which topics, angles and formats will resonate with our audience.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Performance-driven:</strong> you can own a budget and prove its impact. You think in meetings, opportunities, pipeline and revenue.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Hands-on:</strong> you can build a European strategy one day and fix a missing microphone the next. Neither is beneath you.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Strong editorial instinct:</strong> you understand Sales and know why people show up, what they’ll remember and what they’ll tell others about.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Great with people:</strong> you know how to get Sales reps, speakers, partners and vendors moving in the same direction.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Highly organised:</strong> you can run several events at once and stay calm when something inevitably goes wrong.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A fierce negotiator:</strong> you negotiate hard, spend carefully and never accept the first sponsorship package.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Fluent in English</strong> (French is a plus)</p></li></ul><h3>Bonus points</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ve created an event or activation people were still talking about months later.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h1>How to apply &amp; recruitment process</h1><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>How to apply: send us your LinkedIn and one event or activation you've built that you're proud of (links, photos, results: attendance, meetings, pipeline). </strong><br /><strong>No concrete example, no review.</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><ol style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Screening call (30 min)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Business case (async) + live debrief (45 min)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Culture fit with the team</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">CEO interview</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Reference check</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Offer</p></li></ol><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/lemlist/gtm-experience-manager-field-event-marketing-paris-348843","tags":["Marketing"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Paris","created_at":1794606017},{"slug":"senior-full-stack-product-engineer-paris-333562","company_name":"The Flex","title":"Senior Full-Stack Product Engineer","description":"<h2>About Us</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://Base360.ai"><strong>Base360.ai</strong></a> is the AI operating system for short-term rental businesses, helping property managers run their operations on autopilot.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Born out of The Flex, a short-term rental operator that scaled to an eight-figure business using its own software, <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://Base360.ai">Base360.ai</a> is now launching as a standalone platform for short-term rental operators worldwide.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We bring reservations, guest communication, pricing, payments, cleaning, maintenance, and reporting into one platform—helping operators automate manual work, reduce costs, increase revenue, and scale their portfolios.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're looking for an ambitious <strong>Senior Full-Stack Product Engineer</strong> who wants to turn real customer problems into intuitive, reliable software. You'll work closely with founders, designers, and operators to identify what matters, build solutions, and improve them based on how people use them.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you enjoy owning the full journey from customer problem to shipped product—and you're excited by AI, automation, and short-term rentals—we want to meet you.</p><h2>What You'll Build</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">As a Senior Full-Stack Product Engineer, you'll help shape and scale <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://Base360.ai">Base360.ai</a> across the entire short-term rental lifecycle.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll build customer-facing features, operational dashboards, automation engines, AI-powered workflows, and integrations that help property managers grow without increasing their workload at the same rate.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Your work will connect what users see with the systems behind it—from a guest’s check-in experience to the workflows coordinating reservations, cleaning, payments, and owner reporting.</p><h2>Your Mission</h2><h3>Understand Customer Problems</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work directly with property managers and internal teams to understand their workflows, identify friction, and decide which problems are worth solving.</p><h3>Build Products End-to-End</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Take features from idea and prototype through frontend, backend, integrations, testing, and deployment. Own the complete experience and how it performs in production.</p><h3>Create Intuitive User Experiences</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with designers to make complex short-term rental operations easy to manage. Build interfaces that help users complete tasks quickly and confidently.</p><h3>Create Powerful Automations</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build event-driven workflows that eliminate repetitive work—from scheduling cleaning after a booking to sending check-in instructions and generating owner statements.</p><h3>Develop AI-Powered Features</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Use LLMs and AI agents to automate guest communication, triage maintenance requests, support pricing decisions, and help operators manage their portfolios more efficiently.</p><h3>Connect the Ecosystem</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build reliable APIs and integrations with platforms including Airbnb, Hostaway, Stripe, Twilio, OpenAI, Google, and other partners across the short-term rental ecosystem.</p><h3>Solve Real Operational Problems</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build solutions for:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Real-time reservation and availability synchronization</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Dynamic pricing intelligence</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Smart lock access and key management</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Automated guest communication across channels</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Guest check-in and upsell journeys</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Operational forecasting</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Cleaning and maintenance automation</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Owner reporting and financial workflows</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">AI-powered monitoring and alerts</p></li></ul><h3>Measure and Improve</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Use customer feedback, product usage, and operational results to evaluate what you ship. Improve features based on adoption, time saved, fewer errors, and better user outcomes.</p><h3>Build for Scale</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Make sound technical decisions that balance delivery speed, maintainability, security, and reliability as more operators and properties join the platform.</p><h2>Tech Stack</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We care more about capability than specific technologies, but our current stack includes:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Python</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">FastAPI</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">React</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">TypeScript</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Supabase</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">PostgreSQL</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">AWS</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Serverless architecture</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">OpenAI APIs</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Twilio</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Stripe</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Docker</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">GitHub Actions</p></li></ul><h2>You Might Be a Great Fit If You Have</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong experience building and shipping production software</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The ability to work across frontend and backend systems</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with React, TypeScript, Python, FastAPI, or similar technologies</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong understanding of APIs, databases, integrations, and cloud architecture</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A product mindset and curiosity about why users need a feature</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Good judgment around usability, scope, and technical trade-offs</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The ability to turn an ambiguous problem into a practical, working solution</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Confidence working directly with customers, designers, and founders</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The ability to work independently and own outcomes</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Curiosity about AI, automation, and operational efficiency</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A bias toward shipping, learning, and iterating</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bonus points for experience with:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Short-term rentals, hospitality technology, or property management systems</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Multi-tenant SaaS platforms</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Marketplace businesses and booking chann