&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/gitlab/remote-commercial-account-executive-netherlands-17631","tags":["EMEA - Commercial"],"job_types":[],"location":"Remote","created_at":1794466516},{"slug":"senior-integration-software-engineer-amsterdam-221011","company_name":"Optics11","title":"Senior Integration Software Engineer","description":"<p>We are looking for an experienced <strong>Senior Integration Software Engineer</strong> to bring our algorithms and software backend together into reliable, operational solutions, and to take technical ownership of how our software is integrated.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW75090954 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">Optics11 is a deep-tech company developing advanced fiber-optic sensing technologies for challenging environments and applications in energy and underwater security. Our systems enable high-performance sensing and monitoring through advanced photonics, signal processing, and data-driven intelligence.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>We are expanding our R&amp;D team with an Integration Software Engineer who enjoys building clean, reliable interfaces between components and working where software meets hardware, and who takes ownership of making complex systems work together end to end.</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW17873096 BCX8" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>As a Senior Integration Software Engineer, you will support their integration into operational systems: connecting algorithms to the backend through robust APIs, building data connectors, health reporting and control software, and defining and verifying integrations with Command and Control (C2) systems.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>You will work closely with domain experts in acoustics, signal processing and machine learning, and with the software engineering team, and hands-on with our monitoring systems at our headquarters and production facility. You will also take technical ownership of work delivered by internal and external engineers and set the standard for good engineering practices.</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW57822337 BCX8" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong></h4><ul><li><p>Lead software integration engineering for our underwater acoustic sensing systems, ensuring frontend and backend components, algorithms, and hardware systems work together reliably.</p></li><li><p>Integrate the algorithmic toolbox with our system backends, turning research code into maintainable, versioned and deployable software components.</p></li><li><p>Implement data interfaces for our real-time sonar processing pipeline, to ingest multiple sensors (acoustic, heading, temperature, pressure, etc.) from internal and external data acquisition systems. Implement health reporting, logging and monitoring, so that the status and performance of software and system components is visible and actionable.</p></li><li><p>Develop the software control layer for our sensing systems and their hardware components, including APIs for commanding, state handling, error handling and recovery.</p></li><li><p>Implement, align and verify software integrations with external partners and C2 systems, being directly involved in defining interfaces, maintaining interface specifications and running joint integration tests.</p></li><li><p>Testing &amp; debugging: Develop system-level test suites and CI/CD pipelines, diagnose communication failures, and ensure secure, reliable data transfers as the toolbox and backends evolve.</p></li><li><p>Address performance, latency and scalability of the integrated pipeline, together with algorithm and backend developers.</p></li><li><p>Work hands-on with integrated software and hardware systems at our headquarters and production facility, with occasional on-site visits.</p></li><li><p>Review the work of junior engineers and external development partners in depth, promote good practices for packaging, versioning and release, and share integration knowledge across the team.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong><span style="color:#121317">Why Join Us?</span></strong></h4><ul><li><p>Join one of Europe’s most promising deep-tech scale-ups.</p></li><li><p>Shape the future of a rapidly growing multidisciplinary R&amp;D organization.</p></li><li><p>Competitive salary and benefits package.</p></li><li><p>Enjoy regular team activities and company events.</p></li><li><p>Fresh team lunches provided 5 times/week.</p></li></ul> <br> <h4>Qualifications:</h4><ul><li><p>BSc or MSc in Computer Science, Software Engineering or a related field.</p></li><li><p>Significant professional experience in software engineering, with a focus on system integration, backend or platform development.</p></li><li><p>Extensive experience developing production software in Python, including packaging, testing, dependency management and writing maintainable, well-structured code.</p></li><li><p>Familiarity with systems programming in C++, or Rust, for the purpose of extending Python for more performance or hardware control.</p></li><li><p>Proven experience designing and implementing APIs and messaging interfaces (e.g. MQTT, WebSocket) and data serialization (e.g. protobuf).</p></li><li><p>Experience with realtime data pipelines, and handling high-throughput or streaming data.</p></li><li><p>Experience with Docker, CI/CD and automated testing in a Linux environment.</p></li><li><p>Experience working with software that interacts with physical systems, and comfort doing hands-on integration and troubleshooting in a lab or production environment.</p></li><li><p>Experience reviewing code and designs, mentoring junior engineers, and setting engineering standards.</p></li><li><p>An outcome-focused mindset, with the ability to own a problem end to end or break it down for others.</p></li><li><p>Ability to work with algorithm developers and translate research code into robust, maintainable software.</p></li><li><p>Flexible and proactive in taking on what needs to be addressed, and comfortable in a fast-paced scale-up environment.</p></li><li><p>Good communication skills in English and the ability to coordinate with internal teams and external partners.</p></li><li><p>Willingness to work primarily from our Amsterdam headquarters, as parts of the role involve classified information and physical systems.</p></li></ul><h4></h4><h4>Nice to Have:</h4><ul><li><p>Knowledge of defense systems or defense standards (e.g. NATO STANAGs, MIL-STD), for example in naval, maritime security or surveillance systems.</p></li><li><p>Experience with the scientific Python stack (e.g. NumPy, SciPy) or integrating signal processing or ML models into production systems.</p></li><li><p>Experience developing software interfaces for controlling instruments or devices.</p></li><li><p>Experience with other messaging or streaming frameworks (e.g. Kafka, ZeroMQ, DDS).</p></li><li><p>Familiarity with observability tooling.</p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW236113144 BCX8" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW236113144 BCX8"><strong>Security &amp; Compliance:</strong></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW236113144 BCX8">You'll be working with clients in the defense and security sectors, obtaining a Certificate of No Objection issued by the AIVD (Dutch General Intelligence and Security Service) is mandatory. This means you will need to undergo a security screening. For more information, please refer to details on security screening.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/optics11/senior-integration-software-engineer-amsterdam-221011","tags":["R&D"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Amsterdam, Noord-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1794465080},{"slug":"senior-value-engineer-ai-process-optimization-copenhagen-amsterdam-468754","company_name":"celonis","title":"Senior Value Engineer - AI & Process Optimization (Copenhagen)","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This role is based on-site/hybrid in &lt;strong&gt;Copenhagen&lt;/strong&gt;, Denmark. We welcome applicants open to relocate and eligible to work in Denmark.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Value Engineering is responsible for our largest Fortune 500 customers and owns their transformation journey by working on the very frontier of what’s possible with data and AI on the Celons Platform. Partnering closely with the Sales team, Value Engineering is responsible for ensuring that the Celonis Platform is deployed to tackle the most strategic business challenges, fits into the right place in our customers’ technology stack and most importantly generates strong ROI through deep and broad deployments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt; As a Senior Value Engineer, you will spearhead AI and data-driven business transformation within the Retail sector by contributing to your customer’s end-to-end value journey using the Celonis Context Model. Working alongside Lead and Principal VEs, you will combine technical execution with consulting and project management. As an AI-fluent operator, your core mandate is to orchestrate complex roadmaps and execute targeted transformation initiatives that improve how these businesses operate across their [Core Functional Area] ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value Selling &amp;amp; Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Uncover the real issues by peeling back layers of organizational complexity. Own the Outcome from first discovery through realized ROI for your process areas. Tell the Value Story by crafting powerful executive narratives and leading business value workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivate powerful executive sponsorship across core business units to champion transformation programs. Co-own change management with customer leaders and design CoE roadmaps that build self-sufficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Steer Global Transformations across complex workstreams. Own and implement AI-driven account planning and AI-assisted project management. Automate executive governance (QBRs, SteerCos) with minimal manual friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as an AI-fluent operator, utilizing AI tools for rapid technical outputs while partnering with Applied Value Engineers for deep-dive solution builds. Champion platform adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Value &amp;amp; Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Build a strategic expansion roadmap embedding Celonis as a strategic platform to drive adoption. Provide feedback to R&amp;amp;D based on evolving customer use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of experience taking ownership of complex workstreams, process areas, and customer relationships in Value Engineering, Consulting, or Pre-Sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Technical &amp;amp; Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid background in enterprise IT and business software (e.g., SAP, Workday, Salesforce, Oracle). You operate primarily as an AI-fluent operator, utilizing AI copilots to generate outputs and automations, avoiding heavy manual coding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder Mentality:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable setting your own direction within an account team. Driven to &lt;em&gt;live for customer value&lt;/em&gt;, proactively hunting and ideating for highest-impact solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; Value Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven expertise in executing process improvements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Program &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated expertise orchestrating multi-region or business unit transformation programs. Expert at mobilizing VP/Director-level sponsorship. Flawless English communication with commanding executive presence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of the Finance/Supply Chain domains and Retail trends. You stay continuously updated on business-critical use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Degree:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineering, Computer Science, Mathematics, Business Analytics,&amp;nbsp; comparable technical degree or a Business/Economics degree paired with a technical minor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-NS1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/celonis/senior-value-engineer-ai-process-optimization-copenhagen-amsterdam-468754","tags":["Value Engineering"],"job_types":[],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1794455725},{"slug":"working-student-content-creator-amsterdam-333346","company_name":"Teampicnic","title":"Working Student Content Creator","description":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-intro-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section-inner&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a hands-on, creative Content Creator Working Student to help tell our story. You’ll own our employer branding organic social content from start to finish brainstorming bold concepts, shooting, editing, and hitting the publish button. Working alongside recruiters, campaign managers, and designers, you’ll turn daily life behind the scenes into engaging content that stops top-talent scroll and gets them excited to join our ride.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master the End-to-End Creative Process:&lt;/strong&gt; Pitch bold ideas, direct colleagues on camera, shoot mobile-first, and cut the final edit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn Raw Stories into High-Engagement Assets:&lt;/strong&gt; Capture real, behind-the-scenes moments and turn everyday footage into clips that our target persona actually wants to watch on LinkedIn and Instagram.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Refine Visual Craft &amp;amp; Brand Consistency:&lt;/strong&gt; Sharpen your eye for pacing, color, and smart branding to make every piece of content look pro and cohesive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Currently enrolled student:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently pursuing a Bachelor’s or Master’s in Media, Film, Communication, Design, or a related creative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong short-form editing chops:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with Adobe Suite and CapCut, with a strong feel for hooks, retention editing, tempo, sound design, and color grading/color theory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable behind the lens:&lt;/strong&gt; Confident shooting content on both a smartphone and a camera, with a solid eye for framing, lighting, and composition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems thinker:&lt;/strong&gt; You know how to build organized project files that can be easily adapted and reused across different social platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent in English (Dutch, French, or German is a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Availability&lt;/strong&gt;: Available for at least 16 hrs p/w (the more, the merrier!) for a minimum of 6 months.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bonus: Working knowledge of After Effects for animations/graphics, or photography skills.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don’t tick all the boxes yet? Picnic is the perfect learning environment for the highly ambitious and the deeply curious. If you align with Picnic’s mission, please feel free to send your application through.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Picnic Perks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;🚀&lt;strong&gt;Every expert was once a beginner!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll have plenty of chances to grow, whether it&#39;s through our casual Lunch &amp;amp; Learn sessions or team specific trainings. We&#39;re especially keen on keeping great talent around; perform well as a working student, and we would love to explore transitioning you into a full-time role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;🌍&lt;strong&gt;Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;🤝&lt;strong&gt;Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;💪&lt;strong&gt;Stay healthy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Mental health is important. As well as having the option to speak with Picnic colleagues who act as confidential advisors, our collaboration with OpenUp gives you easy access to professional psychologists, along with workshops and materials.&lt;br&gt;There are plenty of sports communities and events to get involved with, from tennis to yoga to climbing!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;💰&lt;strong&gt;Attractive package&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll receive a gross hourly wage of €16,75 (incl. holiday pay) along with a laptop to support your work. Travel costs can also be reimbursed, depending on your location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/teampicnic/working-student-content-creator-amsterdam-333346","tags":["Students"],"job_types":[],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1794455722},{"slug":"stage-office-management-mbo-hbo-eindhoven-238739","company_name":"Zibber","title":"Stage Office Management (mbo/hbo)","description":"<p><span style="color:#000000">Een kerstviering organiseren waar collega's nog lang over napraten? Een externe bijeenkomst tot in de puntjes regelen? Of zorgen dat alles op kantoor lekker loopt?</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Bij Zibber krijg je de kans om het allemaal te doen. We zoeken een enthousiaste stagiair Office Management die energie krijgt van organiseren, regelen en dingen voor elkaar krijgen.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Geen stage waarin je alleen maar meekijkt. Hier doe je écht mee!</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3><strong><span style="color:#000000">Over Zibber</span></strong></h3><p><span style="color:#000000">Met zo'n 240 collega's in Nederland, België en Duitsland zijn we marktleider in vastgoedmedia. Met fotografie, video en slimme technologie helpen we makelaars om woningen perfect te presenteren.</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Op ons hoofdkantoor in Eindhoven werken zo'n 60 collega's samen. De sfeer? Informeel, energiek en altijd in beweging. We werken hard, lachen veel en houden van mensen die initiatief nemen.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3><strong><span style="color:#000000">De rol</span></strong></h3><p><span style="color:#000000">Binnen de stage Office Management werk je nauw samen met onze Executive Assistant en helpt bij alles wat ons kantoor en onze interne projecten nét wat beter maakt.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Denk aan:</span></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Het organiseren van Zibber-events, borrels en teamactiviteiten.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Het regelen van offsites en externe bijeenkomsten, van locatie tot catering.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Zorgen dat alles op kantoor soepel verloopt.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Contact met leveranciers en het oppakken van praktische verzoeken.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Meewerken aan leuke interne projecten en verbeterideeën.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p><span style="color:#000000">En zie jij iets dat slimmer, leuker of makkelijker kan? Laat van je horen!</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h2><strong><span style="color:#000000">Wat je van ons krijgt</span></strong></h2><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Een afwisselende stage waarin je écht iets kunt bijdragen.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Ruimte om zelfstandig dingen op te pakken en eigen ideeën uit te voeren.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Persoonlijke begeleiding van onze Executive Assistant.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">De kans om veel te leren over office management, events en projectmatig werken.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Een werkplek op ons gezellige hoofdkantoor in Eindhoven.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Korte lijnen, enthousiaste collega's en volop Zibber-events, lunches en gezelligheid.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Een stagevergoeding van €450,- bruto per maand bij een fulltime stage.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Bij een fulltime stage in principe vier dagen meewerken en één dag ruimte voor school.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Starten in januari of februari 2027!</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <p><span style="color:#000000">Je volgt een mbo 4- of hbo-opleiding en zoekt een meewerkstage.</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Verder vinden we vooral belangrijk dat je:</span></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Positieve energie meebrengt en graag de handen uit de mouwen steekt.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Zelf initiatief neemt en niet afwacht.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Makkelijk communiceert en vragen durft te stellen.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Houdt van organiseren en overzicht bewaren.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Goed Nederlands spreekt en schrijft.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Ervaring? Mooi meegenomen. De juiste instelling? Veel belangrijker!</span></strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h2><strong><span style="color:#000000">Klinkt dit als jouw stage?</span></strong></h2><p><span style="color:#000000">Ben jij iemand die liever zegt 'Ik regel het!' dan 'Wie gaat dat doen?'?</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Dan pas je waarschijnlijk perfect bij Zibber. Solliciteer en laat ons weten waarom jij graag dingen voor elkaar krijgt. We maken graag kennis met je!</span></p><p><br></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/zibber/stage-office-management-mbo-hbo-eindhoven-238739","tags":["Management"],"job_types":["Student college","internship"],"location":"Eindhoven, Noord-Brabant, Nederland","created_at":1794454298},{"slug":"senior-medewerker-finance-accounting-utrecht-403554","company_name":"Normec Foodcare NL","title":"Senior Medewerker Finance & Accounting","description":"<p class="MsoNormal">Krijg jij energie van een financiële administratie die tot in de puntjes klopt? Heb je ruime ervaring met boekhouding en houd je graag overzicht over financiële processen? Bij Normec Foodcare zoeken we een ervaren Senior Medewerker Finance &amp; Accounting die zelfstandig de financiële administratie beheert, afwijkingen signaleert en bijdraagt aan een correcte maand- en jaarafsluiting.</p><h4>Jouw rol</h4><p class="MsoNormal">Als Boekhoudkundig Medewerker ben je verantwoordelijk voor een correcte en tijdige verwerking van de financiële administratie. Je houdt je bezig met debiteuren, crediteuren, cashmanagement en grootboekcontroles. Daarnaast bereid je de maand- en jaarafsluiting voor en werk je nauw samen met de Financial Controller en andere collega's binnen Finance. Je maakt deel uit van een Finance-team van zeven collega's en rapporteert rechtstreeks aan Patricia Pouw, Finance Manager.</p><p class="MsoNormal">Jouw verantwoordelijkheden zijn verder:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Debiteuren- en crediteurenbeheer:</strong> Je beheert de openstaande posten, verwerkt ontvangsten en inkoopfacturen en onderhoudt contact met klanten en leveranciers over betalingen en factuurverschillen.</p></li><li><p><strong>Cashmanagement:</strong> Je verwerkt bankmutaties, bewaakt de geldstromen en bereidt betalingen voor. Ook ondersteun je bij de liquiditeitsplanning.</p></li><li><p><strong>Voorbereiden van de maand- en jaarafsluiting:</strong> Je zorgt dat de administratie volledig en tijdig is bijgewerkt. Je bereidt boekingen, reserveringen en balansspecificaties voor en ondersteunt bij de jaarafsluiting en accountantscontrole.</p></li><li><p><strong>Grootboek en financiële controles:</strong> Je controleert grootboekrekeningen en financiële aansluitingen, onderzoekt afwijkingen en bereidt correcties voor.</p></li><li><p><strong>Aanvullende administratie:</strong> Je houdt je bezig met intercompany-afstemmingen, vaste activa en de voorbereiding van btw-aangiften.</p></li><li><p><strong>Procesverbetering:</strong> Je signaleert knelpunten, doet verbetervoorstellen en helpt de kwaliteit en efficiëntie van de financiële administratie verder te verbeteren.</p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal">Daarnaast ben je een inhoudelijk aanspreekpunt voor collega's bij complexere boekhoudkundige vraagstukken en ondersteun je hen met jouw kennis en ervaring.</p><h4>Ons aanbod</h4><p class="MsoNormal">Een afwisselende functie bij Normec Foodcare, met ruimte om zelfstandig te werken, mee te denken en jezelf verder te ontwikkelen. Je komt terecht in een betrokken team waarin samenwerking centraal staat. Wat je verder mag verwachten:</p><ul><li><p>Een jaarcontract met uitzicht op een vast dienstverband</p></li><li><p>Een salaris tussen € 4.000 en € 4.500 bruto per maand op basis van een fulltime dienstverband, afhankelijk van jouw ervaring</p></li><li><p>Een dienstverband van bij voorkeur 40 uur per week. Een dienstverband van 32 uur per week is ook bespreekbaar</p></li><li><p>Hybride werken en flexibele werktijden: je kunt je werkdag indelen tussen 07.00 en 19.00 uur</p></li><li><p>25 vakantiedagen en 8% vakantietoeslag</p></li><li><p>De mogelijkheid om extra vakantiedagen te kopen</p></li><li><p>Een goede pensioenregeling</p></li><li><p>Een reiskostenvergoeding</p></li><li><p>De mogelijkheid om deel te nemen aan het fietsplan</p></li><li><p>Een continu ontwikkelprogramma waarin je wordt gestimuleerd om je talenten verder te ontwikkelen</p></li><li><p>Een collectieve ziektekostenverzekering bij VGZ</p></li><li><p>Een actieve personeelsvereniging die het hele jaar door diverse leuke activiteiten organiseert</p></li></ul><h4>Jouw profiel</h4><p class="MsoNormal">Je bent een positief kritisch ingestelde en betrokken professional, die graag meedenkt en bouwt aan onze Finance-afdeling.</p><p class="MsoNormal">Daarnaast beschik je over:</p><ul><li><p>Mbo+/hbo werk- en denkniveau in een financiële of boekhoudkundige richting</p></li><li><p>Minimaal 3 jaar relevante werkervaring als Boekhouder, Financieel Administratief Medewerker of in een vergelijkbare financiële functie</p></li><li><p>Ruime ervaring met zelfstandig boekhouden, debiteuren- en crediteurenbeheer en het voorbereiden van maandafsluitingen</p></li><li><p>Een goed begrip van grootboekadministratie, balansposten, btw en de samenhang tussen boekingen en financiële rapportages</p></li><li><p>Goede vaardigheden in Excel en ervaring met een ERP-systeem. Kennis van Exact Online of Business Central is een pré</p></li><li><p>Je hebt een goede beheersing van de Engelse taal, zowel mondeling als schriftelijk</p></li><li><p>Een nauwkeurige, gestructureerde en proactieve werkwijze. Je voert niet alleen werkzaamheden uit, maar onderzoekt ook zelfstandig afwijkingen en denkt mee over oplossingen</p></li><li><p>Goede communicatieve vaardigheden en het vermogen om prettig samen te werken met klanten, leveranciers en collega's. Je deelt graag je kennis en ondersteunt anderen waar nodig</p></li><li><p>Je bent bij voorkeur 40 uur per week beschikbaar</p></li></ul><h4>Over Normec</h4><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#121317">Normec Foodlab Ede is onderdeel van Normec, toonaangevend in de Testen, Inspectie, Certificering en Compliance (TICC) industrie. Onze expertise raakt essentiële gebieden zoals water-, lucht- en bodemkwaliteit, brandveiligheid en voedselveiligheid, waarbij we de hoogste normen van kwaliteit en veiligheid garanderen in verschillende sectoren. Normec is opgericht in 2016 en is een ambitieuze, onafhankelijke en snelgroeiende organisatie.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#121317">We bieden onze collega’s de kans om actief bij te dragen aan onze missie én tegelijkertijd hun eigen carrière te ontwikkelen binnen een dynamische en snelgroeiende organisatie. Samen werken we aan impactvolle oplossingen voor onze klanten en aan een duurzame toekomst. De cultuur binnen Normec is informeel, open, energiek en ondernemend en is verankerd in onze GROWTH-principes. Middels ons The Normec Fit-programma, waarmee de deze principes tot leven brengen, zorgen we ervoor dat niet alleen ons bedrijf groeit, maar ook iedereen die er deel van uitmaakt.</span></p><h4><span style="color:#121317">Interesse? Laten we kennismaken!</span></h4><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#121317">Ben je geïnteresseerd in deze vacature? Dan kijken we uit naar jouw sollicitatie! We behandelen jouw gegevens vertrouwelijk en zorgen ervoor dat je binnen vijf werkdagen een reactie van ons ontvangt.  Voor vragen over deze vacature kun je contact opnemen met team Recruitment, via </span><u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ----- ----- style="color:#121317"> . Zij helpen je graag verder.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#121317">De procedure:</span></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Eerste telefonische screening en verdere bespreking van de vacature</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Persoonlijk gesprek bij Normec</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Referentiecheck (na jouw goedkeuring)/ assessment</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Tweede gesprek/bespreken arbeidsvoorwaarden bij Normec</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Gefeliciteerd, je hebt je nieuwe uitdaging gevonden</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;Op zoek naar een nieuwe uitdaging binnen de voedingsmiddelenindustrie, maar is deze functie niet helemaal wat je zoekt? Volg </span><u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/2663966/admin/dashboard/"><span style="color:#121317">Careers at Normec Foodcare</span></a></u><span style="color:#121317"> op LinkedIn en blijf op de hoogte van al onze vacatures.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><em><span style="color:#121317">Ongevraagde acquisitie door bureaus wordt niet op prijs gesteld en zal niet worden beantwoord.</span></em></p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":fals