es</p></li></ul><p><strong>What do you bring?</strong></p><ul><li><p>A completed higher professional education or university degree, for example in Data Science, (Business) Informatics, Econometrics, Business Administration or a similar direction</p></li><li><p>Available for 24-32 hours per week</p></li><li><p>0-3 years work experience</p></li><li><p>Initial experience with data or process improvement, for example via an internship, thesis project or first job</p></li><li><p>Basic knowledge of Power BI, knowledge of SQL, Python, ETL processes and modern data platforms (like Microsoft Fabric) is a plus</p></li><li><p>Affinity with business processes in a trading or international environment, interest in digitization and automation, and curiosity about how AI can improve your work and processes</p></li><li><p>Strong communication skills in Dutch and English, and ability to explain complex analyses clearly</p></li><li><p>A proactive, critical and structured work attitude and eagerness to develop yourself</p></li></ul><p>Want to learn more about Royal Ingredients Group B.V.? Click <u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.royal-ingredients.com/products/">HERE</a></u>.</p><p><strong>Our offer</strong></p><ul><li><p>A market-conform salary matching your experience and profile;</p></li><li><p>Good pension scheme and bonus scheme;</p></li><li><p>27 vacation days on a full-time basis;</p></li><li><p>Room for professional development and own initiative;</p></li><li><p>Hybrid working (including one fixed day working from home);</p></li><li><p>An informal and professional work atmosphere with involved colleagues;</p></li><li><p>Regular fun team and company activities.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Interested?</strong></p><p>Interested in a conversation to get to know each other better? <br>Apply via the application button and we will contact you as soon as possible.</p><p>Do you have questions about the role or recruitment process? Contact <strong>Sonja Wezepoel (HR Business Partner)</strong> or <strong>Denise Teunissen (HR &amp; Recruitment)</strong> via <strong>+31 6 81025025</strong> or <u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ---------- or consulting agency?</em></p><p><em>We appreciate your interest, but we look for all our candidates directly. We understand you want to present your candidates our interesting positions, but this is not how we have structured our recruitment process. This means all unsolicited profiles will be treated as direct applications for our vacancies.</em></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/cefetra-group-bv/junior-business-data-analyst-alkmaar-367366","tags":["Royal Ingredients Group B.V."],"job_types":["Entry","parttime fixed term"],"location":"Alkmaar, Noord-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1794421885},{"slug":"stageplaats-bij-pharmapartners-oosterhout-452036","company_name":"PharmaPartners","title":"Stageplaats bij Pharmapartners","description":"<p>Wil jij als meewerk- of afstudeerstagiair(e) het verschil voor de zorg maken en jezelf ontwikkelen als professional? Jij doet dat bij PharmaPartners. Hoe? Dat lees je hieronder:<br /><em><strong><br /></strong></em><br /></p>
